<title>USA: Polaroid Corp Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Polaroid Corp Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.74		    $0.51</p>
<p> Net			 34,200		   23,700</p>
<p> Sales		    569,100		  580,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  46,426		   46,326</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary loss	 $1.16     loss	 $0.64</p>
<p> Net loss		  52,500     loss	29,200</p>
<p> Sales		    725,600		  690,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  45,587		   45,399</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - First Call Q3 mean estimate was $0.67 per share</p>
<p>Results for the first nine months of 1995 include a $77 million charge for restructuring.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
